WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.553 --> 00:00:13.617
Mrs. Wiggles grinned.

2
00:00:13.637 --> 00:00:18.119
"We're so happy to see you, Rocket Girl.

3
00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:21.580
Our plan was to suck you out of school."

4
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.701
Mr. Presto chuckled.

5
00:00:23.721 --> 00:00:26.002
"That didn't work.

6
00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.263
But luckily you showed up anyway."

7
00:00:28.283 --> 00:00:30.103
"What do you want?"

8
00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:31.144
Roxy demanded.

9
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:32.952
Dr. Odd cackled.

10
00:00:33.613 --> 00:00:36.673
"We want to get rid of you—once and for all!"

11
00:00:37.574 --> 00:00:39.374
He fired an energy blast at Roxy.

12
00:00:39.814 --> 00:00:41.975
Ba-zoom! "Whoa!"

13
00:00:42.455 --> 00:00:43.135
Roxy jumped.

14
00:00:44.035 --> 00:00:45.516
Mr. Presto waved his wand.

15
00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:48.997
"Presto!" A brick wall appeared.

16
00:00:49.617 --> 00:00:51.798
Bam! "Oof!"

17
00:00:52.058 --> 00:00:53.178
Roxy fell on her back.

18
00:00:53.878 --> 00:00:55.199
Stomp, stomp!

19
00:00:55.779 --> 00:00:57.359
The robot rushed toward Roxy.

20
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.100
A heavy foot came down on her.

21
00:01:00.912 --> 00:01:01.913
Roxy grabbed the foot.

22
00:01:02.693 --> 00:01:04.034
She flipped the robot backward.

23
00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:07.896
Crash! The building shook.

24
00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:10.617
"Gah!" Dr.

25
00:01:10.677 --> 00:01:11.238
Odd cried.

26
00:01:12.418 --> 00:01:14.059
Principal Penn saw the wall shake.

27
00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:15.700
She looked around.

28
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:17.801
No one was guarding them anymore.

29
00:01:17.821 --> 00:01:20.563
"Everyone, back to school!"

30
00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:23.504
The teachers and students hurried outside.

31
00:01:24.505 --> 00:01:26.126
Mr. Presto waved his wand again.

32
00:01:26.766 --> 00:01:29.888
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

33
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:31.520
But Mr.

34
00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.181
Presto vanished before they struck.

35
00:01:34.382 --> 00:01:36.482
Roxy felt the licorice rope wrap around her.

36
00:01:36.502 --> 00:01:38.243
"Got you!"

37
00:01:38.703 --> 00:01:39.704
Mrs. Wiggles shouted.

38
00:01:40.484 --> 00:01:41.284
Roxy groaned.

39
00:01:42.025 --> 00:01:43.565
"I hate licorice!"

40
00:01:44.526 --> 00:01:47.827
Ba-zoom! An energy blast knocked Roxy over.

41
00:01:48.927 --> 00:01:50.728
Outside, Terrell heard the noise.

42
00:01:50.748 --> 00:01:52.529
"Roxy's in trouble!"

43
00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:55.190
He climbed through a window.

44
00:01:58.211 --> 00:01:59.772
Mr. Presto raised his wand.

45
00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.282
Whoosh! Roxy used her super breath.

46
00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:05.905
The wand flew from his hand.

47
00:02:07.606 --> 00:02:08.487
Terrell caught it!

48
00:02:09.828 --> 00:02:10.689
Roxy smiled.

49
00:02:10.709 --> 00:02:13.311
"Terrell!" "Don't move!"

50
00:02:13.732 --> 00:02:15.453
Terrell pointed the wand at the magician.

51
00:02:16.374 --> 00:02:17.835
Mr. Presto held up his hands.

52
00:02:17.855 --> 00:02:20.197
"Don't cast a spell on me!"

53
00:02:21.378 --> 00:02:23.960
Mrs. Wiggles dropped the licorice rope and ran for the door.

54
00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.664
"You'll never catch me!"

55
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.241
Roxy quickly freed herself.

56
00:02:31.701 --> 00:02:33.762
She swung the licorice rope and caught Mrs.

57
00:02:33.822 --> 00:02:36.843
Wiggles. "No!"

58
00:02:37.344 --> 00:02:38.144
the villain cried.

59
00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:41.045
Roxy heard heavy footsteps.

60
00:02:42.506 --> 00:02:44.107
Dr. Odd was running toward Terrell.

61
00:02:44.127 --> 00:02:46.588
"Get my wand!"

62
00:02:46.648 --> 00:02:47.788
Mr. Presto yelled to Dr.

63
00:02:47.928 --> 00:02:49.809
Odd. Whiz-hoo!

64
00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:51.850
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

65
00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:55.251
The robot exploded.

66
00:02:55.291 --> 00:02:57.132
Dr. Odd lay on the floor, moaning.

67
00:03:00.064 --> 00:03:02.385
Roxy quickly tied up the villains with the licorice rope.

68
00:03:03.185 --> 00:03:04.386
Then she turned to Terrell.

69
00:03:04.406 --> 00:03:05.967
"Thanks for the help!

70
00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:07.327
Ready to fly?"

71
00:03:08.368 --> 00:03:09.588
Terrell's face lit up.

72
00:03:10.409 --> 00:03:11.969
Roxy held Terrell with one hand.

73
00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.270
She held the bundled villains with the other.

74
00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:20.393
"Whoa!" Terrell laughed as he and Roxy soared over Metro City.

75
00:03:21.293 --> 00:03:22.694
They dropped off the villains at prison.

76
00:03:25.495 --> 00:03:27.316
Then he and Roxy returned to school.

77
00:03:29.476 --> 00:03:30.397
"Roxy, Terrell!"

78
00:03:30.657 --> 00:03:31.218
Mara said.

79
00:03:31.238 --> 00:03:33.360
"You missed everything!

80
00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.882
Villains kidnapped everyone from school."

81
00:03:35.902 --> 00:03:38.344
"Rocket Girl saved us!"

82
00:03:38.604 --> 00:03:39.205
Jack said.

83
00:03:39.225 --> 00:03:42.448
"Really?" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

84
00:03:42.468 --> 00:03:45.350
"I can't believe we missed that!"

85
00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:46.271
Terrell said.

86
00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:47.832
He glanced at Roxy.

87
00:03:48.793 --> 00:03:50.054
The two friends chuckled.
